@@ -1,3 +1,16 @@
+# Unreleased
+New features:
+- Built-in FFT spectrum analyzer, replacing the external "filter bank" hack.
+  Computes averaged log-spaced spectrum levels of the source (capture side)
+  and destination (playback side) of the pipeline in a dedicated thread at
+  10 Hz, and serves them via the websocket commands `GetSpectrumLevels`,
+  `GetSpectrumConfig`, `SetSpectrumEnabled`, `SetSpectrumChannel`,
+  `SetSpectrumBins`, `SetSpectrumSmoothing`, `SetSpectrumFftSize` and
+  `SetSpectrumInterval`. Disabled by default, and near zero cost while
+  disabled. FFT size (1024-8192, default 2048) and update interval
+  (50-1000 ms, default 100 ms) are runtime tradeable between accuracy
+  and CPU cost.
+
 # 4.1.3
 Bugfixes:
 - Increased capture ringbuffer sizes in CoreAudio, WASAPI, ASIO, and threaded ALSA
